# Docs that `make check-docs` does not yet enforce.
#
# This list ONLY ratchets down. `make check-docs` passes
# `--assert-exempt-max` with the number in the makefile (DOCS_EXEMPT_MAX), so
# removing an entry is a two-line commit — delete the line, lower the number —
# and adding one is a visible, arguable diff that has to be defended in review.
#
# Nothing here is exempt because it does not matter. Everything here is exempt
# because nobody has re-verified it against the thing it describes, and a
# status stamp is a claim that somebody did. Stamping these today would
# manufacture exactly the false verification the gate exists to catch.
#
# To remove an entry: re-read the doc against the code or the live host, fix
# what is wrong, add the stamp, delete the line, lower DOCS_EXEMPT_MAX.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
